Follow `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root on every task. It is the source of truth for this project.

- Product: kids learning app (parent account + kid profile). Backlog: `KIDZIO-FEATURES.md`.
- Language: ship in Georgian (`ka`). Use `lang/ka` + `__()` for UI; DB content (questions, etc.) uses `locale=ka`. Keep structure ready for other locales later — do not default new copy to English.
- Stack: Laravel 13, Livewire 4 (single-file `⚡*.blade.php`). Not Vue.
- Architecture: repositories for all Eloquent, services for business logic, thin Livewire components.
- Parent-gated features stay behind PIN / parent verification.
- UI is a port of `kidzio/`, not a redesign. Screen-port playbook: `.cursor/rules/kidzio-screen-port.mdc`. Reference: `resources/views/pages/⚡user-login.blade.php`.
